      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31761_toraeru_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{網|あみ}→網：22587_ami⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{鳥|とり}→鳥：00679_tori⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{捕|と}らえた。",
      "english": "I caught a bird with a net.",
