    {
      "id": "31761_toraeru_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{警察|けいさつ}→警察：01393_keisatsu⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{逃|に}げた→逃げる：01151_nigeru⟧⟦{男|おとこ}→男：00561_otoko⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{三日後|みっかご}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{捕|と}らえた。",
      "english": "The police caught the man who had fled three days later.",
