  ],
  "notes": "More written and formal than ⟦{捕|つか}まえる→捕まえる：01214_tsukamaeru⟧, the everyday word for catching someone.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{犯人|はんにん}→犯人：03572_hannin⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{捕|と}らえる: to catch a criminal\n- ⟦{獲物|えもの}→獲物：08638_emono⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{捕|と}らえる: to catch prey\n- {捕|と}らえられる: to be captured\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{捉|とら}える→捉える：12795_toraeru⟧: same reading, for grasping something abstract: ⟦{意味|いみ}→意味：01155_imi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{捉|とら}える→捉える：12795_toraeru⟧ (to grasp the meaning), ⟦{心|こころ}→心：01321_kokoro⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{捉|とら}える→捉える：12795_toraeru⟧ (to capture someone's heart)\n- ⟦{捕|つか}まえる→捕まえる：01214_tsukamaeru⟧: to catch; the everyday word",
